        "original_id": "4fb26902-e358-5012-9372-32e3d4a219bc",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Peter B. Gillis, Sal Buscema\n- Characters: Ghaur\n- Publications: Eternals\n- Organizations: Celestials, Eternals, Deviants\n- Concepts: Earth’s defense, war between Eternals and Deviants\n\nFacts:\n- Peter B. Gillis and Sal Buscema created Ghaur.\n- Ghaur first appeared in \"Eternals\".\n- The alien Celestials originally initiated the process that created the Eternals and the Deviants.\n- The Celestials intended the Eternals to serve as defenders of Earth.\n- The Celestials’ design for the Eternals made war with the destructive Deviants inevitable.",
